    (max specified (`the number of votes entitled to vote at the meeting, or of the class or series voting separately` DIVIDED BY 3))
        DIVIDED BY `the number of votes entitled to vote at the meeting, or of the class or series voting separately`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 216 (src:812)
