      `the number of votes entitled to vote at the meeting, or of the class or series voting separately` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Vote requirement`
`s 216 the requirement for a quorum` `the number of votes the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws require to be present or represented by proxy, if they specify one` `the number of votes entitled to vote at the meeting, or of the class or series voting separately` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the number of votes the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws require to be present or represented by proxy, if they specify one`
