        THEN `at least` (`s 216 the specified quorum, floored at one third, as a proportion of the votes entitled` specified `the number of votes entitled to vote at the meeting, or of the class or series voting separately`) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`
        ELSE `a majority of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`

