§§ `s 216 chapeau: the votes necessary for business`

-- The vote that is necessary: what this chapter requires for a specified action if it requires one (out of range: the section
-- that requires it, taken as a requirement); otherwise what the certificate or bylaws specify, if they specify one;
-- otherwise, in the absence of such specification, the default of paragraph (2).
-- src:812 | the certificate of incorporation or bylaws of any corporation authorized to issue stock may specify the number of shares and/or the amount of other securities having voting power the holders of which shall be present or represented by proxy at any meeting in order to constitute a quorum for, and the votes that shall be necessary for, the transaction of any business, …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 216 (src:812)
GIVEN `the vote this chapter requires for the specified action, if it requires one` IS A MAYBE `Vote requirement` -- out of range: the section that requires it (pieces dg1 to dg11)
      `the vote the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws specify, if they specify one` IS A MAYBE `Vote requirement`
GIVETH A `Vote requirement`
`s 216 the vote that is necessary for a matter other than the election of directors` `the vote this chapter requires for the specified action, if it requires one` `the vote the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws specify, if they specify one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the vote this chapter requires for the specified action, if it requires one`
    WHEN JUST required THEN required
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        CONSIDER `the vote the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws specify, if they specify one`
        WHEN JUST specified THEN specified
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `a majority of` `the shares present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote`

-- The size of the base a vote is counted against, for the three bases a piece of this section can meet. Another base is not
-- covered here: NOTHING.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 216 (src:812-816)
GIVEN requirement IS A `Vote requirement`
      `the number of votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of votes present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote on the subject matter` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of votes cast` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 216 the size of the base the vote is counted against` requirement `the number of votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote` `the number of votes present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote on the subject matter` `the number of votes cast` MEANS
    CONSIDER requirement's `counted against`
    WHEN `the outstanding stock entitled to vote` THEN JUST `the number of votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote`
    WHEN `the shares present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote` THEN JUST `the number of votes present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote on the subject matter`
    WHEN `the votes cast` THEN JUST `the number of votes cast`
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

§§ `s 216(1) to (2): the default quorum and the default vote`

-- (1) A majority of the shares entitled to vote, present in person or represented by proxy, constitutes a quorum at a meeting
-- of stockholders. (2) In all matters other than the election of directors, the affirmative vote of the majority of shares
-- present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting and entitled to vote on the subject matter is the act of the
-- stockholders. The matter carries when the votes in favor meet the vote that is necessary, counted against its base.
-- src:813 | (1) A majority of the shares entitled to vote, present in person or represented by proxy, shall constitute a quorum at a meeting of stockholders;
-- src:814 | (2) In all matters other than the election of directors, the affirmative vote of the majority of shares present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting and entitled to vote on the subject matter shall be the act of the stockholders;
@ref 8 Del. C. § 216(1) (src:813); § 216(2) (src:814)
GIVEN requirement IS A `Vote requirement`
      `the number of votes in favor` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of votes present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote on the subject matter` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of votes cast` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 216(2) the matter is the act of the stockholders` requirement `the number of votes in favor` `the number of votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote` `the number of votes present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote on the subject matter` `the number of votes cast` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 216 the size of the base the vote is counted against` requirement `the number of votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote` `the number of votes present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote on the subject matter` `the number of votes cast`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST base THEN `the vote carries` requirement `the number of votes in favor` base

§§ `s 216(3): the election of directors by a plurality`

-- Directors shall be elected by a plurality of the votes of the shares present in person or represented by proxy at the
-- meeting and entitled to vote on the election of directors. A plurality is not a proportion of a base: a candidate is
-- elected if fewer than N other candidates (N being the directors to be elected) got at least as many votes; not elected if N
-- or more got strictly more; and where the margin is a tie for the last place the text does not say who wins: NOTHING.
-- src:815 | (3) Directors shall be elected by a plurality of the votes of the shares present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting and entitled to vote on the election of directors; and
@ref 8 Del. C. § 216(3) (src:815)
GIVEN `the votes for the candidate` IS A NUMBER
      `the votes for each other candidate` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `the number of directors to be elected` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 216(3) the candidate is elected by a plurality of the votes` `the votes for the candidate` `the votes for each other candidate` `the number of directors to be elected` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the number of directors to be elected` AT MOST 0 THEN NOTHING
        IF `the number of others with at least as many votes` LESS THAN `the number of directors to be elected` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the number of others with more votes` AT LEAST `the number of directors to be elected` THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHERE
        `the number of others with at least as many votes` MEANS
            count (filter (GIVEN other YIELD other AT LEAST `the votes for the candidate`) `the votes for each other candidate`)
        `the number of others with more votes` MEANS
            count (filter (GIVEN other YIELD other GREATER THAN `the votes for the candidate`) `the votes for each other candidate`)

§§ `s 216(4): a separate vote by a class or series`

-- Where a separate vote by a class or series or classes or series is required, a majority of the outstanding shares of the
-- class or series, present in person or represented by proxy, constitutes a quorum entitled to take action on that matter;
-- and in all matters other than the election of directors, the affirmative vote of the majority of shares of the class or
-- series present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting is the act of the class or series.
-- (A quorum the certificate or bylaws specify for a class is under the chapeau: `s 216 a quorum is present` with the class's votes.)
-- src:816 | (4) Where a separate vote by a class or series or classes or series is required, a majority of the outstanding shares of such class or series or classes or series, present in person or represented by proxy, shall constitute a quorum entitled to take action with respect to that vote on that matter and, in all matters other than the election of directors, the affirmative vote of the majority of shares of such class or series or classes or series present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting shall be the act of such class or series or classes or series.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 216(4) (src:816)
GIVEN `the number of votes of the outstanding shares of the class or series` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of those votes present in person or represented by proxy` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 216(4) the class or series has a quorum entitled to take action on the matter` `the number of votes of the outstanding shares of the class or series` `the number of those votes present in person or represented by proxy` MEANS
    `the vote carries`
        (`a majority of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)
        `the number of those votes present in person or represented by proxy`
        `the number of votes of the outstanding shares of the class or series`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 216(4) (src:816)
GIVEN `the number of votes of the class or series present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of those votes in favor` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 216(4) the matter is the act of the class or series` `the number of votes of the class or series present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting` `the number of those votes in favor` MEANS
    `the vote carries`
        (`a majority of` `the shares present in person or represented by proxy and entitled to vote`)
        `the number of those votes in favor`
        `the number of votes of the class or series present in person or represented by proxy at the meeting`

§§ `s 216, closing sentence: a bylaw on the votes for the election of directors`

-- A bylaw amendment adopted by stockholders which specifies the votes necessary for the election of directors shall not be
-- further amended or repealed by the board of directors. For a bylaw of another kind the sentence is silent: NOTHING.
-- src:817 | A bylaw amendment adopted by stockholders which specifies the votes that shall be necessary for the election of directors shall not be further amended or repealed by the board of directors.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 216 (src:817)
GIVEN `the bylaw amendment was adopted by stockholders` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the bylaw amendment specifies the votes necessary for the election of directors` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 216 the board of directors may further amend or repeal the bylaw amendment` `the bylaw amendment was adopted by stockholders` `the bylaw amendment specifies the votes necessary for the election of directors` MEANS
    IF `the bylaw amendment was adopted by stockholders` AND `the bylaw amendment specifies the votes necessary for the election of directors`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE NOTHING
